OL,3,GNEWSAMissing deaf cat hitches a ride
OL,4,A170 miles from home
OL,5,
OL,6,FA deaf cat that went missing six weeks
OL,7,Fago has been found at a service station
OL,8,Fabout 170 miles (274km) away from home
OL,9,Fafter apparently hitching a ride.
OL,11,FQuinn, aged eight, disappeared from St
OL,12,FHelens in Merseyside, despite rarely
OL,13,Fventuring outside her owner's garden.
OL,15,FIt is thought she managed to get into a
OL,16,Fvan or lorry and ended up at services
OL,17,Fon the A1 in Peterborough, where she
OL,18,Fwas found on Thursday, yowling and
OL,19,Fscavenging near some bins.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
