OL,3,GNEWSAMissing deaf cat hitches a ride
OL,4,A170 miles from home
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe white cat was more than happy to
OL,7,Fhave some warmth and attention before
OL,8,Fher owner was able to make the
OL,9,Feight-hour round trip to reunite the
OL,10,Fbeloved cat with her family.
